 Sports CFB 27 cover","description":"EA Sports College Football 27 will also feature Indiana's Curt Cignetti, USC QB Jayden Maiava, Texas' Colin Simmons and Notre Dame CB Leonard Moore on the cover.","published":"2026-06-02T15:31:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/48945575/kewan-lacy-malachi-toney-dante-moore-ea-sports-cfb-27-cover","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Notre Dame on 'revenge tour' after '25 CFP snub, says CB Moore","description":"Notre Dame cornerback Leonard Moore says the Fighting Irish are on a \"revenge tour\" after being excluded from the College Football Playoff last season.","published":"2026-04-08T20:59:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/48432171/notre-dame-cb-moore-says-irish-revenge-tour-cfp-snub","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Marcus Freeman vows teamwork to fix Notre Dame's defense","description":"Notre Dame coach Marcus Freeman says he will not remove playcalling from his first-year coordinator Chris Ash but will work with the team to address the Irish's early defensive struggles.","published":"2025-09-22T22:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/46347699/marcus-freeman-vows-teamwork-fix-notre-dame-defense","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"rittenberg_adam","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas, Penn St. players lead AP preseason All-America 1st team","description":"Texas edge rusher Colin Simmons is among three Longhorns on The Associated Press All-America team. No. 2 Penn State also had three players, giving the Nittany Lions and Longhorns the most on the team.","published":"2025-08-18T20:05:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/46008870/texas-penn-st-players-lead-ap-preseason-all-america-1st-team","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079629/leonard-moore","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonard_Moore_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":3,"round":1,"team":"MIA","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Leonard Moore (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonard_Moore_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Leonard Kevin Moore is an American college football cornerback for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Moore attended Round Rock High School in Round Rock, Texas. During his high school career he had 92 tackles and eight interceptions. He committed to the University of Notre Dame to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Moore entered his true freshman year at Notre Dame in 2024 as a backup. He started his first career game against the Louisville Cardinals and took over as a full-time starter after Benjamin Morrison suffered a season ending injury. He remained a starter for the remainder of the season and was named to numerous freshman All-American teams."}]}}